{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_05749","headline":"赋得云生栋梁间 · 陈希烈","name":"赋得云生栋梁间","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"一片苍梧意，氤氲生栋梁。\n下帘山足暗，开户日添光。\n偏使衣裘润，能令枕簟凉。\n无心伴行雨，何必梦荆王。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"陈希烈","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_05749.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_05749","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}